f33_frac_vacask_dec_var2p5: VACASK control `var n=2.5` with `mode="dec" points=n` from 1k to 100k runs 2 per decade (5 points), as the literal does: truncates, no message (a circuit `parameters n` is not visible here: "Variable or constant n not defined", R68)
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
load "spice/capacitor.osdi"
model vsource vsource
model resistor sp_resistor
model capacitor sp_capacitor
v1 (in 0) vsource dc=0.0 mag=1.0
r1 (in out) resistor r=1k
c1 (out 0) capacitor c=1u
control
  options rawfile="ascii"
  var n=2.5
  analysis ac1 ac from=1k to=100k mode="dec" points=n
endc
